只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"让 DeepSeek Harness 的第三方 API 支持低、中、高等推理强度，并可为每次子 Agent 调用选择模型｜Add Low, Medium, High, and other reasoning levels to third-party APIs, with model selection for each subagent call","id":"gh:1333887780","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-reasoning-settings","slug":"JuneLearn/dsh-reasoning-settings","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","model-provider","openai-compatible","reasoning-effort","web-ui"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"让 DeepSeek Harness 的第三方 API 支持低、中、高等推理强度，并可为每次子 Agent 调用选择模型｜Add Low, Medium, High, and other reason"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ing levels to third-party APIs, with model selection for each subagent call"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Reasoning Settings"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness Web settings plugin that adds an independent **reasoning effort** (thinking inten"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"sity) page for custom `llm-pi-ai` providers. The official UI only exposes effort selection for first"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"-party DeepSeek models; this plugin makes it work for third-party / relay APIs too."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Third-party service recommendation (referral link)**\n>\n> If you are looking for an OpenAI-compat"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ible API relay, you can take a look at WPIronman API. This is my referral link, and I may receive a "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"referral benefit if you register through it; any promotion or benefit is subject to the provider's c"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"urrent terms. This plugin is independent of that service and does not require any particular relay. "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"Evaluate pricing, reliability, and privacy terms before choosing a provider.\n>\n> New users can redee"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"m the gift quota with code `99F509ABC6C38F77`."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Auto-reads the custom providers and models you already added on the official **Models** page.\n- De"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"clares a per-model effort level from `off / minimal / low / medium / high / xhigh / max`.\n- Customiz"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"es the actual wire value sent to the API for each level.\n- Sets a provider-wide default effort, rest"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ricted to the levels supported by every model in that provider.\n- Configures the reasoning wire form"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"at for `openai-completions` providers.\n- Writes back to `llm-pi-ai.providers.*` through the official"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" `settings.mutate` API — API keys are never touched.\n- Fixes in-process subagents inheriting the Age"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"nt's create-time official model instead of the parent's live third-party provider/model selection.\n-"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" Makes subagents inherit an explicit parent reasoning effort, or fall back to the target provider's "},{"id":"p7s9","text":"configured default effort.\n- Resolves model-only child overrides such as `grok-4.5` against user-con"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"figured third-party providers instead of an unrelated official provider.\n- Extends the ordinary `sub"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"agent` and `subagent_fork` tools with per-call `provider`, `model`, and `reasoning_effort` fields, w"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"ithout replacing their official lifecycle, background, or result behavior."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Live demo"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Install Node.js. DSH currently supports Node.js 22.19.x or version 24 and newer; Node.js 24 LTS is"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" recommended. Node.js includes `npm` and `npx`.\n- Install Git so the plugin can be fetched from its "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"GitHub repository.\n- Install pnpm. Both methods require pnpm because `dsh plugin` invokes it in the "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"profile directory to install or remove plugins.\n- Your network must reach `registry.npmjs.org` and `"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"github.com`. Configure a working network proxy if npm or GitHub is unavailable or unstable in your r"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"egion.\n- Method 1 does not require a DeepSeek Harness source checkout. Method 2 additionally require"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"1 does not require a DeepSeek Harness source checkout. Method 2 additionally requires that checkout."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Check the basic environment first:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"If `corepack enable` fails with a permission error, run it once from an Administrator PowerShell. Al"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ternatively, use another option from the pnpm installation guide."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"If downloads remain on a spinner or fail with `ECONNRESET`, `ETIMEDOUT`, or a GitHub connection erro"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"r, set a proxy for the current PowerShell window. Port `7890` is only an example; replace it with yo"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ur proxy's actual port:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"These variables only affect the current PowerShell window and disappear when it is closed."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Method 1: npx (recommended for regular users)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"This method does not require a DeepSeek Harness source checkout or a global `dsh` installation, but "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Git and pnpm must already be available. On its first run, `npx` downloads `@deepseek-ai/dsh` and its"},{"id":"p19s3","text":" dependencies, which can take several minutes:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Start Web through the same package runner after installation:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Method 2: pnpm with the Harness source tree (recommended for developers)"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Use this method if you already cloned `deepseek-harness` and want to run its source directly. First "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"confirm pnpm is available:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Enter the DeepSeek Harness source root. Install its dependencies once, then install the plugin:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Start Web from that source directory afterward:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The package's `dsh.bundle` declaration adds the plugin to the Web profile automatically. Neither met"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"hod requires editing `cordis.patch.yml`. Web listens on `http://127.0.0.1:3080` by default; it uses "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"another port only when the default is occupied or you explicitly select one."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Upgrade"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Run the corresponding install command again to upgrade. No uninstall or profile-patch maintenance is"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"rresponding install command again to upgrade. No uninstall or profile-patch maintenance is required."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"npx method:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"pnpm source method:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"npx method:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"pnpm source method:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"DSH removes both the dependency and its bundle layer. Restart `dsh web`; the **Reasoning effort** se"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"ttings page is removed."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"1. Add your custom provider and models on the official **Models** page first.\n2. Open **Settings > R"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"easoning effort**.\n3. Pick the supported levels for each model and set the provider default effort.\n"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"4. Click **Save** under that provider.\n5. Start a new session and choose the model and reasoning eff"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"ort in the model picker."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Built against the public dual-end plugin, settings-slot, `settings.mutate`, agent-scoped tool shadow"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"ing, Agent lifecycle, and `agent/request` waterfall interfaces of DeepSeek Harness `0.1.0-rc.5`. Har"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"ness is still in Developer Preview; if the plugin stops loading or subagent routing changes after an"},{"id":"p47s4","text":" upgrade, check those interfaces and the subagent session metadata."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
